{
  "name": "Detect Magic",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>For the duration, you sense the presence of magical effects within 30 feet of yourself. If you sense such effects, you can take the Magic action to see a faint aura around any visible creature or object in the area that bears the magic, and if an effect was created by a spell, you learn the spell's school of magic.</p><p>The spell is blocked by 1 foot of stone, dirt, or wood; 1 inch of metal; or a thin sheet of lead.</p><div class=\"cat-description\"><p><em>midi-qol: only you get the effect. Casting tells you whether you sense magic within 30 feet. The Sense Magic action (the Magic action of the spell) whispers you the specifics, within 30 feet and not behind walls that block sight: magic items creatures carry, by kind (a longsword, a potion, never by name), magical effects on them (never by name, with the school of a spell's), and magical areas (regions a spell or magic item made, with the spell's school, or regions marked Magical in the region editor). Creatures you can't see are reported as unseen.</em></p><p><em>Automation requires Coven's Automation Toolkit (CAT).</em></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
